          "label": "Quality decided in the",
          "source": "Quality decided in the"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-f014ee1633",
          "label": "field.",
          "source": "field."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-7fb6044f5d",
          "label": "Concentrate quality is set before the fruit reaches the factory. We c...",
          "source": "Concentrate quality is set before the fruit reaches the factory. We contract directly with growers in the Delta and Upper Egypt, agree varieties and harvest windows ahead of the season, and take delivery within hours of picking so that sugar and colour arrive intact."
        },
